{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact · {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#3b82f6;--muted:#6b7280;--bg:#f8fafc;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);}    
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial; color:#0f172a;background:var(--bg);}    
    .pattern{position:fixed;inset:0;opacity:0.06;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:240px;pointer-events:none}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.8), rgba(255,255,255,0.6));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#6ee7b7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
    .container{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(12,18,32,0.06);}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:22px;color:#071330}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 16px 0;color:var(--muted)}
    .mood-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}
    .mood{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(12,18,32,0.06);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,var(--glass));cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a}
    .mood[aria-pressed="true"]{outline:3px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.14);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(59,130,246,0.06)}
    .recommend{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .rec-pill{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eef2ff,#f0fdf4);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:#082032;font-weight:600}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}
    form .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(12,18,32,0.06);border-radius:8px;font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:110px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .accordion{margin-top:10px}
    .acc-item{border-top:1px solid rgba(12,18,32,0.04)}
    .acc-btn{width:100%;text-align:left;padding:14px;background:none;border:0;font-size:15px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}
    .acc-panel{padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(12,18,32,0.03);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(250,250,252,0.8),transparent);font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);display:none}
    .acc-item[open] .acc-panel{display:block}
    .crisis{margin-top:18px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff8f2;border:1px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.08);color:#7f1d1d}
    .footer{padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.container{padding:18px}.logo{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Meet</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="book.html">Events</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card">
        <h1>Reach out and we’ll respond thoughtfully</h1>
        <p class="lead">Use the form to share what’s on your mind; the mood selector below helps shape a recommended first step and updates the quick action button.</p>

        <div>
          <div class="small" style="margin-bottom:6px">What best describes how you’re feeling right now?</div>
          <div class="mood-row" role="list" aria-label="Mood selector">
            <button class="mood" data-key="overwhelmed" aria-pressed="false">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="stuck" aria-pressed="false">Stuck / Stalled</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="curious" aria-pressed="false">Curious to try therapy</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="transitional" aria-pressed="false">Life transition</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="intensive" aria-pressed="false">Need short-term focus</button>
          </div>

          <div class="recommend">
            <div class="rec-pill" id="methodPill">Recommended: Brief assessment</div>
            <div style="flex:1">
              <div id="methodDesc" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">I’ll suggest a way of working that fits what you described. Pick a mood to preview options and a direct action.</div>
              <a class="cta" id="primaryCta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <hr style="margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(12,18,32,0.04)" />

        <form id="contactForm" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="post" aria-label="Contact form">
          <div class="field"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" required /></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" required /></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" /></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="goal">Brief note about what you want to focus on</label><textarea id="goal" name="goal" placeholder="A sentence or two helps me prepare"></textarea></div>
          <input type="hidden" name="recommended_method" id="recommended_method" value="brief_assessment" />
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><button type="submit" class="cta">Send request</button><div class="small">or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div></div>
        </form>

        <div class="accordion" aria-hidden="false">
          <div class="acc-item" id="bounds">
            <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleAccordion('bounds')">Session boundaries & mutual expectations <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button>
            <div class="acc-panel">Sessions are delivered in scheduled 45–55 minute blocks unless otherwise agreed. I ask that we keep to our agreed meeting times and provide 48 hours' notice for cancellations when possible. Missed sessions without adequate notice may be billed. If we agree to work together, I will share my intake and consent forms that outline fees, scheduling norms, and communication preferences.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item" id="conf">
            <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleAccordion('conf')">Confidentiality & limits <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button>
            <div class="acc-panel">What you share is private and kept in a secure record. There are a few legal limits to confidentiality including imminent risk of harm to you or others, suspicions of abuse of a child or vulnerable person, or when required by a court. If we work together I will review these details and answer any questions about privacy, records, and how I communicate outside sessions.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crisis" role="note">
          If you are in immediate danger, please call your local emergency number (for U.S. dial 911) or your local crisis line. If you are thinking about harming yourself or someone else, call your crisis line now. This contact form is not monitored for emergencies.
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside class="card">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px">
          <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a78bfa,#60a5fa);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700">MD</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Clinical note</div>
            <div class="small">I provide short-series support, single-focus intensives, and referral guidance. No guarantees are made about outcomes—therapy is a collaborative exploration.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:6px">Practical info</strong>
          <div class="small">Sessions by telehealth and a limited number of in-person appointments. Fees and scheduling details are shared during the intake conversation.</div>
        </div>

        <hr style="margin:12px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(12,18,32,0.04)" />

        <div>
          <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px">Quick actions</strong>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
            <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" class="small" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent)">Email: {{EMAIL}}</a>
            <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" class="small" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent)">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>
            <a href="book.html" class="small" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent)">See upcoming sessions & events</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr style="margin:12px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(12,18,32,0.04)" />

        <div>
          <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:6px">Payment & insurance</strong>
          <div class="small">I provide receipts for self-pay and can discuss options during intake. I do not offer billing guarantees and will clarify what is and is not submitted to insurers.</div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">By contacting me you agree to receive a reply via phone or email. For questions about privacy and records, I will provide a written agreement during intake.</div>
  </main>

  <script>
    (function(){
      const moods = {
        overwhelmed: {method:"Short-stabilization session",desc:"A focused first meeting to identify immediate coping steps and arrange follow-up. Useful when things feel intense but you want a clear next step.",cta:"Request short session",key:"short_stabilization"},
        stuck: {method:"Exploratory series",desc:"A sequence of sessions to map patterns, try practical skills, and decide on a longer plan if helpful.",cta:"Start exploratory series",key:"exploratory_series"},
        curious: {method:"Introductory consultation",desc:"A 20–30 minute consult to answer questions about process and fit—no pressure to commit.",cta:"Book a consultation",key:"intro_consult"},
        transitional: {method:"Transition planning",desc:"A targeted set of meetings to support life changes (career, relationships, relocation) with practical tools and pacing.",cta:"Plan transitional work",key:"transition_planning"},
        intensive: {method:"Focused short-term intensive",desc:"A compressed set of sessions centered on a specific goal—skill-driven and time-limited.",cta:"Discuss a short intensive",key:"short_intensive"}
      };

      const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
      const methodPill = document.getElementById('methodPill');
      const methodDesc = document.getElementById('methodDesc');
      const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');
      const recommendedField = document.getElementById('recommended_method');

      function setMood(key, el){
        // visual
        buttons.forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false'));
        if(el) el.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');
        // update copy
        const m = moods[key];
        methodPill.textContent = 'Recommended: ' + m.method;
        methodDesc.textContent = m.desc;
        primaryCta.textContent = m.cta;
        // update form hidden
        recommendedField.value = m.key;
        // update cta link to include the chosen method as query param
        try{
          const url = new URL('{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}', window.location.origin);
          url.searchParams.set('recommended', m.key);
          primaryCta.href = url.toString();
        }catch(e){
          primaryCta.href = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
        }
      }

      buttons.forEach(btn=>{
        btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
          setMood(this.dataset.key, this);
        });
      });

      // default mood: curious
      setMood('curious', Array.from(buttons).find(b=>b.dataset.key==='curious'));

      // accordion helper
      window.toggleAccordion = function(id){
        const el = document.getElementById(id);
        const btn = el.querySelector('.acc-btn');
        const expanded = btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
        btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
        if(!expanded) el.setAttribute('open',''); else el.removeAttribute('open');
      };

      // graceful fallback: intercept form to add recommended method param if action is same origin
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        // allow normal submit; but ensure recommended_method exists
        if(!recommendedField.value) recommendedField.value = 'brief_assessment';
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and notes for the private practice template.

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — The contact page with a mood-driven selector and accessibility-minded accordion for session boundaries and confidentiality.

Key features implemented:
- Mood-to-Method selector: Five mood buttons update a recommended approach, description, and the primary CTA text and URL query (client-side only). The chosen recommendation is also placed into a hidden form field (recommended_method) so the intake request can reflect the user’s immediate needs.
- Session boundaries & Confidentiality accordion: Two accessible accordion items (Session boundaries & mutual expectations, Confidentiality & limits). Both are written in clinician-voice and include a crisis footer reminding users to call emergency services for immediate danger.
- Form: Standard contact fields with a required name and email, plus a message area and a hidden recommended_method field populated by the mood selector.
- No external assets used. The page references a local SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for subtle visual texture (unique pattern expected to be provided in the assets folder elsewhere).

Placeholders to be replaced where server-side templating or a CMS will insert real values:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Accessibility & legal notes:
- The page avoids implying guarantees or medical claims and contains clear confidentiality and limits language.
- The crisis notice instructs users to call local emergency services in urgent situations and states that the form is not monitored for emergencies.

Integration guidance:
- Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists and follows the expected visual style for the site.
- If the contact form should POST to a server, configure {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} to accept form submissions or wire up a client-side handler to send data to your intake endpoint.
- The mood selector appends a recommended parameter to the CTA link and stores a machine-friendly key in the hidden form field; use that value to route requests to appropriate intake flows.

Design notes:
- Navigation labels intentionally differ from other pages (Meet, Offerings, How I Work, Investment, Events) to provide variety across the site.
- Copy uses grounded, clinician-authored language and avoids manipulative urgency.

If you need a matching SVG pattern file or a variant of the mood-to-method mapping, I can generate those next."}
BUNDLE_END
